Backport upstream mupen64plus-core 89ac8da3 and 85e71594 (Morilli, 2026-05-30):
treat every COP0 opcode with rs >= 16 as a TLB-group instruction and decode undefined TLB
sub-opcodes as NOP instead of raising a reserved-instruction exception. libdragon idle loops
execute such an encoding (0x42800060); the VR4300 ignores it, 2.6.0 faulted.

